* Remember to source the venv when running commands from the project
* The program can be ran with `nex`command
```
nex ingest "<filename>"
nex drop-db
nex "<prompt anything>"
```
* Linter can be ran with the following command: `lint <path_to_file_or_directory>`
* DO NOT TOUCH .env file

## This is the top level directory structure for the project:
```
pyproject.toml              # Project metadata and dependencies
cli/                        # Command-line interface
├── main.py                 # CLI entry point
├── commands/               # Individual CLI commands
└── tools/                  # CLI utility tools
common/                     # Shared utilities
graphlib/                   # Core knowledge graph implementation
└── database/               # Database layer
    ├── models/             # Database models
    └── repositories/       # Database repositories
```